      "id": "claim_bcb766eb751d4219989a780b2d49536a",
      "statement": "components/trusted-actions/tests/actions/ holds Go integration tests under the `integration` build tag that exercise individual trusted actions end-to-end against a running Backplane stand-in; TestMain probes MOCK_BACKPLANE_URL (default http://localhost:8087) and PROXY_BACKPLANE_URL (default http://localhost:8088) for availability and honors a TEST_BACKPLANE=mock|proxy selector that exits the test binary immediately with an error if the requested backend is unreachable.",
